OL,3,GLondon & South East
OL,4,
OL,5,CToday:FWednesday will be dry and
OL,6,Fsettled across the region with lots of
OL,7,Fsunshine developing, once any early
OL,8,Fpatches of mist clear. It will feel
OL,9,Fvery hot in the afternoon, with only a
OL,10,Fvery light breeze blowing.
OL,11,
OL,12,CTonight:FThere'll be plenty more hot
OL,13,Fsunshine to end the day, and largely
OL,14,Fclear skies are then likely this
OL,15,Fevening. However, patchy cloud will
OL,16,Fgradually edge in from the northwest
OL,17,Fovernight.
OL,23,QppppppppppppppppppppGSource: Met Office
OL,24,ANext Page  BWeather  CReg News  FReg TV
