OL,3,GLondon & South East
OL,4,
OL,5,CThursday:FSome early bright spells,
OL,6,Fbut cloud will continue to feed across
OL,7,Fthe region on Thursday morning, with
OL,8,Fthe small chance of a shower
OL,9,Fdeveloping. Sunshine returning later,
OL,10,Fbut feeling fresher.
OL,11,
OL,12,COutlook for Friday to Sunday:FIt looks
OL,13,Flargely dry on Friday and during the
OL,14,Fweekend. Though remaining a little
OL,15,Fcooler and fresher there will be some
OL,16,Fvery warm sunshine at times, with
OL,17,Fgentle winds.
OL,23,QppppppppppppppppppppGSource: Met Office
